  "description": "Update 23rd January ’26 : Only one frame left in stock – XL.\n\nChoose your size, finish, and cable routing below.Routing can be set up for Internal, External, or Wireless (SRAM eTap) systems — just select your preference when ordering.\n\nOnce your selections are made, checkout online — your frame ships in 4 weeks.\n\nYour next favourite bike starts here.\n\nYour Stayer All Road is built for every kind of ride — from long endurance days to rough backroads and everything in between. It’s a do-it-all road bike frame that feels planted, smooth and fast, whether you’re loading up for a big day out or heading off for a quick spin before work.\n\nDesigned and TIG-welded in East London from Columbus steel tubing, it’s the kind of frame you’ll still be riding — and loving — years from now.Add colour-matched fenders, go dynamo for self-powered lighting, or keep it simple in raw steel. However you build it, the All Road gives you confidence, comfort and the kind of connection to the ride that only steel delivers.",
